# Development tools: the human-edited INPUT of the lockfile.
#
# Do not install from this file. Generate the pinned lockfile from it:
#     uv pip compile requirements-dev.in --universal --python-version 3.12 -o requirements-dev.txt
# and install exactly that:
#     python -m pip install -r requirements-dev.txt
#
# Lower bounds only here ("what may work"); exact == pins of every transitive
# dependency live in requirements-dev.txt ("what actually ran").
# Tools are added here in the increment that first needs them.
#
# Compile requirements.txt (runtime) first; the dev lockfile includes it, so both use identical versions.

-r requirements.txt

